963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉艳亭即事 其四","author":"白玉蟾","text":"犬见行人吠，牛寻熟路回。\n烟光迷碧嶂，花片点苍苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25264,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉艳亭即事 其三","author":"白玉蟾","text":"黄鸟新声变，青山霁色妍。\n预为寒食地，晴放海棠天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25265,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉艳亭即事 其二","author":"白玉蟾","text":"夙酒萦怀处，芳亭拄颊间。\n一莺黄翠柳，双鹭白青山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25266,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉艳亭即事 其一","author":"白玉蟾","text":"正月梅花尽，一溪春雨香。\n燕方寻故垒，蜂已葺华房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25267,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示如净讲主","author":"白玉蟾","text":"浩浩春风泛碧梧，娟娟秋水照芙蕖。\n大师佛法无多子，居士身心本一如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25268,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示周道士","author":"白玉蟾","text":"前山隐隐起雷声，细雨丝丝濯旱氛。\n何处飞来松上鹤，晚风唳断九天云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25269,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示周道士","author":"白玉蟾","text":"人行秋色里，诗入画图中。\n笑指白云顶，猿啼第一峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25270,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示英州风僧","author":"白玉蟾","text":"宗门老衲旧仪刑，配字年来老转青。\n谁道南能无一物，如今英石尽铜腥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25271,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立马待舟","author":"白玉蟾","text":"拂晓匆匆马首东，嫩寒初破酒无功。\n自知雾帽清珠湿，少立霜桥脆玉松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25272,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春","author":"白玉蟾","text":"颛帝位方禅，勾芒印已交。\n芭蕉有封事，黄鸟莫譊譊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25273,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元旦在鹤林偶作","author":"白玉蟾","text":"东风吹散柳梢雪，一夜挽回天下春。\n从此阳春应有脚，百花富贵草精神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25274,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙井","author":"白玉蟾","text":"山腰石有千年润，海眼泉无一日乾。\n天下苍生望霖雨，不知龙在此中蟠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25275,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙虎山祈雨早行有作","author":"白玉蟾","text":"两三条电复无雨，六七点星微上云。\n鞭起卧龙我骑去，挥戈叱问五雷君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25276,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙潭 其二","author":"白玉蟾","text":"惊崖却立挨斜日，老桧前临接断烟。\n水鸟负暄闲整翼，山禽相贺已晴天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25277,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙潭 其一","author":"白玉蟾","text":"尖峰簇簇穿林笋，曲径盘盘绕树藤。\n中有古潭深万丈，老龙独卧似禅僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25278,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤春词寄紫元 其四","author":"白玉蟾","text":"望眼生花泪已枯，青衣也合递归书。\n客情无奈春风雨，更问春空有雁无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25279,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤春词寄紫元 其三","author":"白玉蟾","text":"孤村古馆雨凄凄，客里愁闻乌夜啼。\n枕冷衾寒才闭目，春风吹转梦魂迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25280,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤春词寄紫元 其二","author":"白玉蟾","text":"幽人何事苦伤春，春雨无端愁杀人。\n不但幽人独愁怨，江头多少柳眉颦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25281,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤春词寄紫元 其一","author":"白玉蟾","text":"幽人抱膝掩柴门，八九渔家烟水村。\n坐对青山两无语，春风春雨送黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25282,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]